gorithm:\n  - Finds flights from origin to all destinations in next 90 days\n  - Identifies lowest price flight per destination\n  - Calculates average price per destination for comparison\n  - Selects only flights cheaper than average (discount deals)\n  - Sorts by savings percentage (highest savings first)\n  - Returns max 8 deals\n  - Assumes 1-week return trips (departure_date + 7 days)\n\n- Returns Deal objects with:\n  - `id`, `destination_code`, `destination_city`, `destination_country`\n  - `departure_date`, `return_date`\n  - `price`, `average_price`, `savings_percent`\n  - `gradient` - one of 8 pre-defined gradient strings for UI\n\n**Other related functions:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/explore-destinations.ts` - Gets destinations and lowest prices\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/explore-dates.ts` - Gets date-specific pricing with filtering by range (weekend/1week/2weeks)\n\n**Redux integration:**\n- File: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/exploreSlice.ts`\n- Defines `Deal` interface with all above fields\n- Creates `fetchExploreDeals()` async thunk that calls `/api/explore-deals?origin={originCode}`\n- Manages state: `deals[]`, `dealsLoading` boolean\n\nAll test files follow consistent patterns using Playwright with strong reliance on `data-testid` attributes for element selection, and include proper async/await handling with reasonable timeouts."}],"totalDurationMs":35526,"totalTokens":42895,"totalToolUseCount":20,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7555,"cache_read_input_tokens":33683,"output_tokens":1653,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7555},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
